<style>
  .si-author-section {
    background-color: #fcf9e2;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .si-author-section {
      min-height: 668px;
    }
  }
  .si-author-col1,
  .si-author-col2 {
    width: 100%;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .si-author-col1,
    .si-author-col2 {
      width: 50%;
      height: 100%;
    }
  }
  .si-author-col1 {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .si-author-col1 img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 585px;
    object-fit: contain;
    object-position: top center;
    margin-top: 27px;
  }
  .si-author-col2 {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 40px 20px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .si-author-col2 {
      padding: 0;
    }
  }
  .si-author-container {
    margin-top: 27px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 400px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .si-author-container {
      width: 29vw;
      max-width: none;
    }
  }
  .si-author-container img {
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: block;
    max-width: 100%;
  }
  .si-author-heading {
    font-size: 40px;
    color: #610a1e;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    font-family: var(--si-serif), serif;
    font-weight: 500 !important;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .si-author-text {
    color: #610a1e;
    font-size: 15px;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
    text-align: left;
    font-family: var(--si-sans), sans-serif;
  }
  .si-author-text + .si-author-text {
    margin-top: 27px;
  }
</style>

<section class='si-author-section'>
  <div class='si-author-col1'>
    <img src='{{ 'heart-full.jpg' | asset_url }}' alt='Jessie Heart'>
  </div>
  <div class='si-author-col2'>
    <div class='si-author-container'>
      <img src='{{ 'shelf-indulgence.png' | asset_url }}' alt='Shelf Indulgence'>
      <h2 class='si-author-heading'>THE MIND BEHIND STORIES</h2>
      <p class='si-author-text'>
        Jessie Heart has always lived with one foot in reality and the other in a story. As a child, she would gaze out
        car windows, weaving fantastical tales from the world rushing by. That love for storytelling never left her.
        Having been a passionate school teacher for 24 years, wife, and proud mother of four beautiful children, Jessie
        continues to inspire others through her words and creativity.
      </p>
      <p class='si-author-text'>
        A devoted lover of books, history, and all things royal, she finds joy in crafting stories and getting lost in
        new worlds. Having lived an unpredictable—and sometimes unbelievable—life, Jessie meets every plot twist with a
        smile, a laugh, and the fierce determination of a warrior. Her stories and book range are a celebration of
        imagination, resilience, and the magic that lives in us all.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Author",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Author"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
